# Native Filter/Join fusion; all scalar safety premises are checked.
InnerJoin<p0 a0 a1>(Input<t0>,Filter<p1 a2>(Input<t1>))|InnerJoin<p2 a3 a4>(Input<t2>,Input<t3>)|t2 := t0;t3 := t1;p2 := And(p0,p1);a3 := a0;AttrsUnion(a4,a1,a2);AttrsSub(a2,t1);ErrorFree(p0);Deterministic(p0);ErrorFree(p1);Deterministic(p1)
